//   History: 
//   1.0    2025-04-22  HearHellacopters: Made the original file
//
//   PROVENANCE
//   Breadcrumbs for re-checking this against a future build. Symbol names are
//   the durable handle; the addresses only mean anything in the build named
//   beside them, so always match on the name first.
//
//   Builds used here:
//     [WIN]  SAN14_EN.exe.unpacked.exe    Windows x64,   imagebase 0x140000000
//     [OES2] libMusouSPS_sandbox.so       Android ARM32, imagebase 0
//                                         ships the S_* structure and enum
//                                         declarations, not just the code
//
//   Not yet cross referenced against any engine build; the enums and layout here
//   were mapped by hand.
//
//   Where to look when one is available: [OES2] declares structures and enums
//   outright, so search its type library for S_G1TL*, and grep the function list
//   for G1TL, TexPalette or Palette. KTGL_KTF_TEXPALETTE_DIR and
//   KTGL_KTF_TEXPALETTE_FLAG exist there and may or may not be related.
//   ktgl::COES2GraphicsDevice::CreateTexContextBody (0x339D98) is the texture
//   entry point to work outwards from.
//------------------------------------------------

